NOTES ON OBTAINING COUNTY RECORDER DOCUMENTS

Recorded deeds, trust deeds, and liens can often be obtained from:
  • {{ county_agency }} (Tax Collector)
  • {{ county_name }} Assessor-Recorder's office
  • Online via the county recorder portal (varies by county)
  • A licensed title company or escrow officer

There is typically a per-page fee for certified copies. Keep originals
and submit certified copies unless the county requires originals.
